The native OpenPI prefix, attention-mask and action-flow integration follows
Physical Intelligence's OpenPI implementation, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi

The GR00T interface integrates NVIDIA Isaac GR00T N1.7 and its Qwen3-VL
feature streams. Upstream source, checkpoints and their licenses remain in
the official repositories:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T

This repository distributes RayWrist method code and integration utilities.
Upstream model weights and datasets are obtained from their original sources.
